			(property "Description" "Toshiba gate-drive photocoupler, IR LED + Faraday-shielded photo IC, totem-pole N-MOS output (M1 high side, M2 low side), +/-2.5 A peak, VCC 15-30 V, IFLH 5 mA max, tpd 500 ns max, CMTI 15 kV/us, 3750 Vrms, DIP-8 7.62 mm. Needs 0.1 uF between pin 8 and pin 5. LED on -> M1 on -> VO high."
